{"3018340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Elementers", "steam_appid": 3018340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multiplayer Action-Adventure, join the mage ranks and master the most powerful abilities the Master Wizard can cook. Try protecting the human race against the random monsters that keep attacking the villages for some unknown reason that you might find out.<strong><br><br>PVE Story missions with up to 4 players! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game story through missions, alone or with up to other 3 friends! <br>More difficulties are unlocked upon completion.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018340/extras/ec6aba38502cf538cb393f7dbd2526a0.poster.avif?t=1784196846\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018340/extras/ec6aba38502cf538cb393f7dbd2526a0.webm?t=1784196846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018340/extras/ec6aba38502cf538cb393f7dbd2526a0.mp4?t=1784196846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP Gamemodes!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can invite your friend to a duel or have a duel against a random opponent, more PVP Gamemodes coming soon! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018340/extras/eca09a63026f3dfc7e918382b302dc8e.poster.avif?t=1784196846\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018340/extras/eca09a63026f3dfc7e918382b302dc8e.webm?t=1784196846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"